Error [E0120]: `branch` was not moved here, so this part cannot be returned as an owned value
  --> tests/ui/param_nested_field_escape_needs_copy.jet:9:52
    |
  9 | fn escape(branch: Branch) => String :: branch.leaf.text
    |                                                    ^^^^
 Why: the function can access this parameter, but it does not own any part of it
